t:calc(5px + 20.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Furious%20Crater\">Furious Crater</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tAttacks from distance.<br/><br/>A courage leech attacks in melee range. A courage leech will retreat at 1 to 1079 (0% - 4%, deep red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tBe very careful when moving around the spawn as one extra creature can be very hard for the team to deal with. As a shooter, stay far from it to avoid being hit by its area attacks around itself.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On December 01, 2020, its experience was decreased from 29,900 to 23,920, and its loot drop rate was decreased in 15%.</li>\n<li>It didn't walk over <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">Poison Fields</a> until March 09, 2021, when this behavior was changed.</li>\n<li>Its experience was reduced from 23,920 to 21,500 with the balancing changes on April 15, 2021.</li>\n<li>Its experience was further reduced to 18,900 with the changes on June 01, 2021.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 9,892 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">